ext":"### Cursor plugin"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"This repo ships a Cursor plugin manifest at `.cursor-plugin/plugin.json`."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"- **From the marketplace / Customize panel:** open **Customize** in the Cursor sidebar, find **posti"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"z**, and select **Install** (project or user scope).\n- **Local install (development):**"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"then restart Cursor or run **Developer: Reload Window**."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"The plugin exposes the `postiz` skill, which drives the `postiz` CLI (the CLI handles media uploads,"},{"id":"p16s2","text":" which is required for image/video posts). Make sure the CLI is installed (`npm install -g postiz`) "},{"id":"p16s3","text":"and authenticated (`postiz auth:login` or `export POSTIZ_API_KEY=...`) before asking the agent to po"},{"id":"p16s4","text":" authenticated (`postiz auth:login` or `export POSTIZ_API_KEY=...`) before asking the agent to post."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"### Gemini CLI extension"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"This repo is a Gemini CLI extension (`gemini-extension.json` at the root) and is indexed in the exte"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"Gemini CLI extension (`gemini-extension.json` at the root) and is indexed in the extensions gallery."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"It installs the `postiz` skill and the hosted Postiz MCP server (`https://mcp.postiz.com/mcp-oauth-d"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"ynamic`). Gemini CLI opens a browser to sign in to Postiz on first use; run `/mcp auth postiz` to re"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"-authenticate. The skill drives the `postiz` CLI for media uploads, so install it with `npm install "},{"id":"p20s4","text":"-g postiz` for image or video posts."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"### Qwen Code"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Qwen Code installs Claude Code marketplaces directly, so no separate manifest is needed:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"### DeepSeek Harness plugin"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"This repo ships a DeepSeek Harness (`dsh`) bundle at `plugins/dsh-postiz`. It connects the agent to "},{"id":"p25s2","text":"the hosted Postiz MCP server and registers a `postiz` workflow skill."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"The Postiz tools then appear as `mcp__postiz__*` (`integrationList`, `integrationSchema`, `scheduleP"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"ostTool`, ...). Self-hosted instances override `baseUrl` on the `postiz` row. See the plugin README "},{"id":"p27s3","text":"lf-hosted instances override `baseUrl` on the `postiz` row. See the plugin README for configuration."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"# Postiz CLI"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"**Social media automation CLI for AI agents** - Schedule posts across 28+ platforms programmatically"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"*Social media automation CLI for AI agents** - Schedule posts across 28+ platforms programmatically."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"The Postiz CLI provides a command-line interface to the Postiz API, enabling developers and AI agent"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"s to automate social media posting, manage content, and handle media uploads across platforms like T"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"witter/X, LinkedIn, Reddit, YouTube, TikTok, Instagram, Facebook, and more."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"### From npm (Recommended)"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## Authentication"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"### Option 1: OAuth2 (Recommended)"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"Authenticate using the device flow — no client ID or secret needed:"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"This will:\n1. Display a one-time code in your terminal\n2. Open your browser to authorize\n3. Automati"},{"id":"p38s2","text":"cally save credentials to `~/.postiz/credentials.json`"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"#### Self-Hosting the Auth Server"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"By default, `postiz auth:login` uses the hosted auth server at `cli-auth.postiz.com`. If you want to"},{"id":"p41s2","text":" self-host the OAuth2 device flow server, follow the guide in `server/SERVER.md`."},{"id":"p42s1","text":"### Option 2: API Key"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"**Optional:** Custom API endpoint"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"> **Note:** OAuth2 credentials take priority over the API key when both are present."},{"id":"p47s1","text":"## Commands"},{"id":"p48s1","text":"### Discovery & Settings"},{"id":"p49s1","text":"**List all connected integrations**"},{"id":"p50s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p51s1","text":"Returns integration IDs, provider names, and metadata. Use `--group` to return only the channels ass"},{"id":"p51s2","text":"igned to a specific group (customer)."},{"id":"p52s1","text":"**List all groups (customers)**"},{"id":"p53s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p54s1","text":"Returns all groups (customers) for your organization as `{id, name}`. Use a group's `id` with `integ"},{"id":"p54s2","text":"rations:list --group` to filter channels."},{"id":"p55s1","text":"**Get integration settings schema**"},{"id":"p56s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p57s1","text":"Returns character limits, required settings, and available tools for fetching dynamic data."},{"id":"p58s1","text":"**Trigger integration tools**"},{"id":"p59s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p60s1","text":"Fetch dynamic data like Reddit flairs, YouTube playlists, LinkedIn companies, etc."},{"id":"p61s1","text":"**Examples:**"},{"id":"p62s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p63s1","text":"### Creating Posts"},{"id":"p64s1","text":"**Simple scheduled post**"},{"id":"p65s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p66s1","text":"**Draft post**"},{"id":"p67s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p68s1","text":"**Post with media**"},{"id":"p69s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p70s1","text":"**Post with comments** (each comment can have its own media)"},{"id":"p71s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p72s1",